OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1785683880
OL,3,CDad climbs Snowdon after being told
OL,4,Che'll never walk again
OL,6,FITV reporter Natalie Verney has been
OL,7,Fspeaking to Sam about his remarkable
OL,8,Frecovery.
OL,10,FA man from Oxfordshire has defied all
OL,11,Fthe odds by climbing Snowdon - just 16
OL,12,Fmonths after surgeons said he'd never
OL,13,Fwalk again.
OL,15,FSam Baldwin from Carterton, broke his
OL,16,Fback and neck in seven places in a
OL,17,Fmotorbike crash.
OL,19,FIt left him paralysed from the waist
OL,20,Fdown.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
