OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38106
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1785683880
OL,3,CDad climbs Snowdon after being told
OL,4,Che'll never walk again
OL,6,F"I've got good friends and what they'd
OL,7,Fgive just to take one step or even,
OL,8,Feven something so simple like flicking
OL,9,Fa page over to read a bedtime story to
OL,10,Ftheir daughter or their son, or
OL,11,Fanybody.
OL,13,FWhat they would give just for that."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
